# Local secrets for `npm run dev` (Cloudflare reads .dev.vars). Copy to .dev.vars. Never commit .dev.vars.
# Random string, at least 32 chars. Generate: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
# In production set it with: npx wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
